{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act22side_level_act22side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act22side",
  "stageId": "act22side_06",
  "title": "無人知曉",
  "storyCode": "FC-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9975642570e520c58b95511eb4fc8746450f1fbb3c0917c48626c33bd6e822d4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看守士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道你在想什麼，但你的大呼小叫可不會分散我們的注意力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真的？那邊似乎有打起來的響動，你們不用去支援？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看守士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，別對我大喊大叫的，維多利亞人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咕——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看守士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安靜，不然小心自己的頭骨碎開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們......維多利亞人，憑什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看守士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要太把自己當回事，塔拉人。我對你們沒有什麼偏見或者仇恨，最多覺得你們可悲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看守士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們不過是一支被利用的政治勢力，公爵的一枚棋子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看守士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "出於禮貌，我們對你們已經很友善，但要知道，一幫流民死在這裡，不會給我們帶來任何損失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看守士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......來命令了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看守士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果需要支援，我們就按照隊長的安排，先處理這裡的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特別行動隊士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "目標往一隊方向逃脫，一二隊保持追擊，其餘人後撤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特別行動隊士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "給她們會合的機會，一併逮捕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "葦草，你是怎麼擺脫那個調查官的？我跟陳陳正要去救你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，別發呆呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這邊人少，我們抓緊機會突圍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......其他人......還在樹林那邊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "應該是。我們先想辦法衝出去，然後去救他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——有弩手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特別行動隊士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們真以為能逃脫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_662_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些弩手之前沒有出手過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_662_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們還有埋伏，數量未知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_662_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們能被這麼多精銳戰力迎接，還真是給面子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是不管有多少人，現在也只能一個一個打過去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不......等等，風笛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除我們之外，他們還要面對其他對手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，你說得對。他們在調度隊伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......執行很快，應該是事先確定的作戰計劃。眼前可能是有意留給我們的缺口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，這荒野上難道還有人會來嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特別行動隊士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "敵對武裝部隊出現！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特別行動隊士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "投彈準備，警惕誘餌小隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "從黑夜中現身的部隊，與小丘郡街道上浮現的鬼魂如出一轍。\n風笛握緊了手中的破城矛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......深池。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特別行動隊士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已經確認敵方指揮官身份，和您的設想一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赤鐵近衛隊隊長......他以深池的身份來搭救那條德拉克了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......和我的猜測一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "事情可能變成兩位大公爵明面上的衝突，而那位鐵公爵為自己尋找的戰場應該是特倫特郡城內，他們不會在這種時刻太過冒進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "繼續等待時機吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_244",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "發現目標，優先抓捕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_244",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_244",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的武器......你是維多利亞軍人？她身邊居然有維多利亞軍人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，很奇怪嗎？這裡到處都是維多利亞的軍人呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_244",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先將三人分開！不要跟目標外的人過多糾纏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_244",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——目標已經在我們的控制之下，三隊帶目標回撤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "目標......你們說的是，葦草？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好久不見，拉芙希妮......我們算是老朋友嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別太緊張，也別激動，你應該不喜歡用暴力的方式來問候久別重逢的朋友，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真可惜，你本來是可以離開的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要知道，領袖已經默許了你的逃避。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你想帶我走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我不可能回去，那裡也不會再有我的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，那裡......從來就沒有我的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然，你不喜歡自己影子的身份，你不相信那群由自己說出的謊言召集起來的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但不是深池的話，你還能去哪裡？作為一條德拉克，你要去哪裡安身呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拉芙希妮，可憐的拉芙希妮......我其實是真心同情你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畢竟，只有在談到那些虛構的詩歌、華而不實的文字時，你才會對我多說幾句話，就像真的老朋友一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你有自己的生活，你想要像詩人一樣走遍古老的原野，或者只是困在狹小的舊屋裡，成天讀書，以抄寫為生......那都是很好的夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣看來，那艘艦船上的生活，應該是很讓人滿意的呀。你為什麼不乖乖地躲好呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......領袖她知道，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在小丘郡，那些野心家的陰謀，害死了許多無辜的平民。她......是不是早就知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你自己就是最瞭解她的人，為什麼還要找我確認呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們如果沒有死在小丘郡的混戰之中，領袖原本也會親自動手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真可惜。就像“雄辯家”他們，如果在小丘郡乖乖執行命令，不做什麼小動作，原本還可以在領袖身邊多活幾日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蔓德拉如果在倫蒂尼姆辦好領袖交代的事，把“間諜”帶回來，原本不必淒慘地死在下水道旁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......而你如果就那樣逃離你的命運，躲藏起來，原本我也不會想把你帶回深池呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你該慶幸，先找到你的是我，我願意給你時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果現在站在你面前的是“校官”，在你猶豫的那一刻他就會殺了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不......他們只想讓我當影子，我不會再過那種生活......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在灰燼中揮動長槍，一定比刺穿血肉的身軀要容易得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿——！這一下應該足夠讓你們起不來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "葦草，你怎麼樣——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......別看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "每一次施術時，葦草都會閉上眼睛。\n但風笛不會。風笛看見了槍尖燃起的那簇火焰。\n對了，自己不是在小丘郡見過她嗎？那個深池的術師站在廣場的雕像下，冷漠地注視著被火焰焚燒的街道，注視著無數人的生死。\n自己只是相信Outcast，相信羅德島......所以不願意相信自己那一瞥的印象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_662_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "風笛，你那邊怎麼樣？能把深池的人和情報部門的打手引到一起嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "啊？\n嗯，沒問題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，不許你去抓葦草！給我讓開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在招架與攻擊之間的片刻喘息裡，她下意識地再次回頭。\n一陣霧氣漫過她的視野，橫亙在她和葦草之間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所有人，利用好煙霧掩護，切入戰場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_244",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是源石技藝，警惕起來，縮緊陣型！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "重新確認方位！\n啊，“校官”，您到了......是，下面交給您指揮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她要逃出去。煙霧給了她機會，她熟知讓局勢變為混戰的策略。她只需要揮動長槍，驅使火焰。\n可那之後呢？\n她是深池的“領袖”。\n她代表深池的火焰，焚燒過無數土地，取走過許多性命。\n她用自己的聲音說出虛幻的承諾，在演講中一次次地宣稱自己會帶來屬於塔拉人的時代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特別行動隊士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一隊直接突擊，不要害怕傷害目標人物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特別行動隊士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "德拉克的生理耐受性很優秀，幾道傷口殺不死她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她是一條德拉克。\n她的父母為這血統死在節日的大雪夜，她和姐姐輾轉流浪過數座城市，懷著重現舊日王朝野心的政治家編排她們的成長。\n她的火焰與生俱來，至今仍然讓她的五臟六腑灼痛。\n她逃到哪裡，才能從那樣的命運裡逃出去？\n她曾經在羅德島的病床上醒來，倚著床欄讀書。那些文字裡有維多利亞精緻的和平，塔拉悠揚的牧歌。\n但是，受傷的同伴就從她的窗外走過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就算閉上眼睛，她也能看見那座城市的廢墟。她被救了出來，而許多人死在那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看守士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "動手吧，隊長下令了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看守士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "處理掉這些，再去處理深池的傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看守士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別擔心，塔拉人。刀很快的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......好險......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，維恩！我就知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看守士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——哪裡來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......來，來幫幫我啊！救命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "起來！能站起來的都起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不就是捆住手嘛，我們人多！三個士兵而已，還有個受傷了的，我們打得過！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的塔拉流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_242",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，好！我們上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的塔拉流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_242",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跟那天一樣！我們能撂倒那些來村子裡巡邏的維多利亞兵，就能撂倒他們幾個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，維恩，你怎麼掙脫的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我蹲在那邊看葦草的情況，沒人發現，我就悄悄用石頭把繩子磨斷了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唉，想想就後怕，要是我回來得晚了一點，該怎麼辦呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就別想。幫我把繩子鬆開，然後去幫其他人，快點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要好好教訓一下這個傲慢的維多利亞佬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說我們只是被利用？可悲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只知道，我身上的傷，我擦乾過的血和淚，沒有比這更實在的東西了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你又——憑什麼對塔拉人指手畫腳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "報告給，隊長！人質暴動——\n呃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_728_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——應該是放倒了吧？抱歉，我看得不太清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，你力氣還挺大！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有誰被捆著的？我拿這個維多利亞人的刀幫你割開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快點，剛剛他把消息傳出去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "費加爾，你去聽著那邊有沒有士兵追過來。維恩，來幫忙扶一把受傷的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走，能走的先走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "逃難的塔拉人跌跌撞撞地摸索著，跑向樹林的更深處。\n他們逃離了家鄉，逃離了那片泥濘的土地，卻沒有人知道要跑得多快，才能將戰火與死亡甩在身後。\n逃出這片黑夜，是不是就能重新建起安寧的家園？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_242",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，維恩，你是會寫字的，到時幫我寫封信寄回去，我得讓家裡人知道我還活著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_242",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我說好了要釀接骨木酒，你得替我從集市上弄一套釀酒的東西回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，我記下了。沒有帳本我也記下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "接著，他們不約而同地停下了腳步。\n有人輕輕吹起了口哨。\n塔拉人有很多說不出的事情，他們找不到詞語的時候，就只好歌唱。\n唱他們缺酒的酒杯，不在此處的親愛之人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......塞爾蒙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我看著他們打起來了，深池的人也來了。他們都是去抓葦草的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "風笛和陳在幫忙，可是只有她們三個人，是不是不太夠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_728_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我聞到味道了。那邊那麼大的煙，估計是柴火沒燒好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_242",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們搞不好正好能混進去，對吧，塞爾蒙？"
