      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_242",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們剛放倒了那幾個當兵的，沒什麼好怕的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_242",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們也不是要打仗，不用把他們都幹掉，只要把葦草她們救出來就行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_724_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
